{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "79e9edb9c1eabde4e97ed199fa66afff2c6c3771bccfd003704e05760329a9b4", "ja": "初仕事！", "zh": "首次工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4e2d4bfcc4e45428c2437d2a9213f78f1020182165b782bd8bc548c0b151d7eb", "ja": "『I.V.』の初仕事は、アイドルや若手俳優が\n大勢出演する学園ドラマのゲストだった。\nそこで真珠星は、なるの幼馴染で男性アイド\nルの『真田湊』と出会う。湊は織姫の妹の\n真珠星に興味を示し、真珠星は困惑する。", "zh": "“I.V.”的初次工作，是在一部有众多偶像与年轻演员出演的校园剧中客串。\n真珠星在剧组中，遇到了成海的青梅竹马兼男性偶像“真田凑”。凑对织姬的妹妹真珠星表现出了兴趣，令真珠星感到困惑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "6dcf0d8bb7b6fcde6229fa39e866220ece76c786aa2016be493280dbb3bb78a3", "ja": "おはよう、真珠星ちゃん！\n今日は、『I.V.』としての初仕事だね……！", "zh": "早上好，真珠星！\n今天是作为『I.V.』的第一份工作呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "c19c0cb0ff0c3d939d74ec6e7479c6eaf2a5cea250ea0eaca5b53f1ce9c9d62a", "ja": "おはよう、なるちゃん。\n……あれ？　神宮寺さんは？", "zh": "早上好，小鸣。  \n……咦？神宫寺小姐呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "555358595bc3354a3cd0bb57045885d066942b7d94c28a3b060a2d2bac767350", "ja": "いないわよ。\n今日の現場は、私たちメンバーだけ。", "zh": "她不在哦。\n今天的现场，只有我们成员在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "8747ec9a21f848eb5e86bd536ba6501012ab69cddc8a831a7ceefbf6c9322f0d", "ja": "え！？　そんな、\n『I.V.』の初めての仕事なのに！？", "zh": "诶！？怎么会，\n明明是《I.V.》第一次的工作啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "d95ff6c9c9ee13bfc3bfac2135f632860d86594bd0305513ef9b1a32cd86e4d8", "ja": "……？　仕事って、ドラマのゲストでしょ？\nチョイ役じゃない。", "zh": "……？工作也就是去客串电视剧吧？\n不就是个小配角嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "31b8a84cf0c609709b24b72ce59464e01636a751f06a9a35ec6d590af0dd7d08", "ja": "もしかして、緊張してるとか？\n真珠星ったら、意外と度胸がないのね。", "zh": "难道说，你是在紧张吗？\n真珠星，没想到你还挺没胆量的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "b037fb99501d2899651298723e2331d067998798e19898c3118a0ae4c2ccaf45", "ja": "ち、違うってば！\n私は、マネージャーとしての責任の話をしているの！", "zh": "不、不是啦！\n我说的是作为经纪人的责任！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "ea7d057be5e922f06bc8394c7904fb9e71efe3ccdfbe67c7df8209a7f495338b", "ja": "神宮寺さんがいたところで、私達は仕事をするだけよ。\n責任感を持って、ね。", "zh": "不管神宫寺在不在，我们都只是做好自己的工作而已。\n要有责任感，知道吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "c688a67fe38e1b707c70d3f2f3ab90c7c1def7fcfe207a24b959138aa08715e3", "ja": "ぐぬぬ……！", "zh": "唔唔唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "a896db5dd2dee17f36e7a3428269ef700bc7cda117546ce7fbaba9ee87191ff4", "ja": "『I.V.』の最初の仕事は、人気学園ドラマのゲスト。\nなんでも、アイドルが大勢出演している作品らしい。", "zh": "『I.V.』的第一份工作，是作为嘉宾出演一部人气校园剧。\n据说是一部有很多偶像出演的作品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "d1a05c6cae6dca7b48840776b36db1172539ff506ad13024ca777e378b16a554", "ja": "なんか、顔が小さくてスタイルのいい人が\nたくさんいるような……。", "zh": "总觉得里面有好多脸小、身材又好的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "97008b9da2ee679bfd661363c045592613622c5bd09c11fbdb40a2147886b321", "ja": "す、すごい冷静な感想だね……。このドラマの\n出演者は、ほとんどがアイドルや若手の人気俳優だよ。", "zh": "这、这评价还真是冷静啊……这部电视剧的出演者，大多是偶像和年轻的人气演员哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "6dcb7ea5b722143b5e63c175e3a9fec36fb7ba5be5c9ca1e56c82c815927ecc1", "ja": "学園物だし、十代に人気なの。\n私の学校でも、見てる子が多いみたい。", "zh": "是校园题材，所以在十几岁的群体里很有人气。\n我们学校好像也有很多人在看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "5bb3ee3f54b4fc775d8dc1c185ee9f5b518331eb7dd6af71dc3c61ae0c0b1fb7", "ja": "へえ……。資料には目を通したけど、ドラマ出演で\n若年層に『I.V.』をアピールするって事なのかな？", "zh": "哦……我看过资料了，这是想通过出演电视剧向年轻人宣传『I.V.』吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "9de4d3a977207709e7b1808d853a33bb6368d67131d0c0b1da68f2387c3ad005", "ja": "うん、多分そうだと思う。\n今回、『I.V.』は全員、少しだけど台詞があるって。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得大概是这样。\n听说这次《I.V.》的所有人都有台词，虽然不多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "0dab29676d91eecc5e6c4afc4da40dc3ef5882e7c295099f9ef7fc2c73d6e114", "ja": "その中でも、藍さんだけは台詞多めみたい。", "zh": "不过在这之中，蓝小姐好像台词比较多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "3c898a6d90fd499e160cc1514829c116c55cfe0e2e373cc5c04d1d6c279ca956", "ja": "……。なんか、いきなりいい仕事もらってない？\nそれとも、アイドルってこういうものなの？", "zh": "……总觉得，突然接到了个很不错的工作？\n还是说，偶像都是这样的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "f900ce7fc53c7a9c3f06ea1cde2f865fb4617e78cf730caee76935dcf60c0bbd", "ja": "そんな訳ないでしょ。うちの事務所のタレントが\nレギュラーで出てるから、バーターみたいなものよ。", "zh": "怎么可能呢。因为我们事务所的艺人是固定出演的，所以算是顺带的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "037ab4d1378551563ed67341ab85e997ecdc8044498bfd715c9723cedad44998", "ja": "あ、そういうこと……。", "zh": "啊，原来是这么回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "cd8c1fe96f6ef42b042b11d6e9f08861969331aecde9e0ad7a62ccbc79624541", "ja": "なるー！　おーい！", "zh": "原来如此！喂——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "c9d0fcec4a39ec5809487fb063d1497109cc207cfbd86b8b22e81c024fcf9654", "ja": "えっ……あっ！\nみ、湊くん！", "zh": "诶……啊！\n湊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "97311355dcdae60586c4964311bbce5f124276b0beb556af05cc936383bf1fef", "ja": "……誰？", "zh": "……谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "43091ac21f7e3db881e45e64d7e70e3d66fca85d86495a8cd51e8a8980160189", "ja": "……。芸能界のこと、\n本当に何も知らないのね、アンタ……。", "zh": "……。关于演艺界的事，\n你还真是什么都不知道呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "6c9a1cf1350bf21927e670f0e6bac0aff3083f542d03ace8d6bbc06e5409bdf2", "ja": "う、うるさいなぁ。仕方ないでしょ。\nずっと、家事とか勉強で忙しかったんだから。", "zh": "啰、啰唆啦。这也是没办法的吧。\n毕竟我一直都在忙家务和学习啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "ab66f74ef834b3002b7df8d72deda9453cdd2d22017db19893c69e7f388f5d8b", "ja": "SNSでよく見る顔だね。\n確か、二世アイドルとかなんとか……。", "zh": "在社交媒体上挺经常看到的呢。\n我记得，好像是什么星二代偶像来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "d0e744423b02255e8e1e59e9a2d1fdcdcd02b251da4e326e715df257ce616afa", "ja": "あっ、新生『I.V.』揃ってる！？　初めまして、俺は\n真田湊（さなだみなと）！　アイドルやってまーす☆", "zh": "啊，新生的『I.V.』全员都在啊！？初次见面，我是\n真田凑！是个偶像哦～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "384a02c2b5e807447de9d3479e019bc6a2c08386d112ebfb32676f107ea7028f", "ja": "なるちゃん……この人知り合いなの？", "zh": "小鸣……你认识这个人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "2973a6ecc20f028aa6559b2000441134b7df2725d01841cd3ccbe59538e15a85", "ja": "う、うん。うちの両親と、湊くんのお父さんが\n知り合いっていうか……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。应该说是我的父母和凑的爸爸\n认识……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "4e69ac673da6b1e59cda65f2cc49895d4ac7f6a5ad9543288c7b2613db6f6fde", "ja": "うちの父さんも、元アイドルでさ。\nなるとは、俺が子役の頃からの知り合いなんだよね。", "zh": "我爸以前也是偶像。Naru从我还是童星的时候就认识我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "451442bc77ccc3d72b53b586d055dc73781db7c6e8ee13ee35d79db8de37331c", "ja": "なる、新生『I.V.』のメンバー、おめでとう！\nチャンスじゃん、頑張れよ！", "zh": "鸣，恭喜你成为新生『I.V.』的成员！\n这是个机会啊，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "1cc4b2b3c3fba9d99194512dc7f41641575d6b683282d15116eaf160f9236587", "ja": "う、うん……！\nありがとう、湊くん……！", "zh": "嗯、嗯……！\n谢谢你，凑同学……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "8eca0639a7cb6146148cc018e0151f4f8a47594b6fc6e6567eb339a9a78ee743", "ja": "記者会見、すごかったな。\n新生『I.V.』なんて看板掲げてりゃ、当然か。", "zh": "那场发布会，真是厉害啊。\n打着新生『I.V.』的旗号，这也是理所当然的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "29f8300f68c1966911c23c2b7921bb83d7e13c171c7050cf4fc300759b1922fc", "ja": "まずは、オリジナルメンバーの藍さんだろ。\nSNSでバズり散らかすクロエちゃんだろ……。", "zh": "首先，是原成员的蓝小姐吧。\n接着是在社交媒体上引发轰动的克洛艾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "ed8be6a5dcb7d29e3d2186596267aaee055d6d847ff562a459a2756a571e026e", "ja": "んで、三船さんちのなる。\n極めつけが、一宮真珠星！　へえ～。", "zh": "然后是三船家的阿鸣。\n最后压轴的是一宫真珠星！嘿～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1036_020meg", "source_sha256": "7669251d22335f1991cd573d62d566a8f1387ae9933f774eb8ec96ef2273f5b2", "ja": "！？　な、なに？", "zh": "！？怎、怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1037_017kth", "source_sha256": "0442a285f3d1b9d0ef2f890b9b5698dc70b49a9f69ecd86da49301ffc1e1bd1d", "ja": "え？　織姫ちゃんの妹なんでしょ？\n俺、織姫ちゃん好きだったんだよねー。", "zh": "咦？你是织姬的妹妹吧？  \n我以前挺喜欢织姬的来着——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1038_017kth", "source_sha256": "160580010e6af7bcc4c520912f7b922a2dddda044cc73122c31bd3691e1d7e02", "ja": "話題性かな～って思ったんだけど、\n妹、けっこう可愛いじゃん！", "zh": "我本来以为是因为话题性什么的～\n不过，妹妹还挺可爱的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1039_020meg", "source_sha256": "7c00701ec56f03e1ee887f9ccd7e5845ed7bae5a4a61e17f50f76c28e4d858b3", "ja": "ど、どうも……。\nあの、撮影始まるんで、失礼します！", "zh": "那、那个……你好……。\n那个，马上就要开始拍摄了，我先失陪了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1040_017kth", "source_sha256": "19b49261b8fc30d05e166f074827895625f6eb1dffded982953f7fd76b04b0f0", "ja": "えっ、どこ行くの？　待って！", "zh": "诶，你要去哪儿？等等！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1041_017kth", "source_sha256": "865d6d618a87a744b13231c30259e542c9f0e33b379e892ac04eef4afa933655", "ja": "ねーねー、どのシーンに出るの？\n俺と絡む？", "zh": "喂喂，你会在哪个场景登场？\n要和我搭戏吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1042_020meg", "source_sha256": "fdd96a1152cb0d5da8504fda52781e41ce42b6384005fa7727cb72e892258537", "ja": "いや、知らないです……。\nていうか、なんで付いてくるんですか！？", "zh": "不是，我不知道……\n话说回来，你为什么要跟过来啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1043_017kth", "source_sha256": "62cc8736192f1ef66f596eb5f2bb33c26cb5e262ccff6e9fb3535b1a3b7e187c", "ja": "え、いいじゃん。\n仲良くしようよ～！", "zh": "诶，有什么不好的。\n和睦相处嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1044_017kth", "source_sha256": "27bfcc5cd06af019505fde2fffec99325dfbe602ff7e19730820c3bcdcff39bf", "ja": "俺、顔広いからさ。みんなに紹介したげるよ？\n真珠星も、顔売りたいでしょ？", "zh": "我认识的人可多了。要不要我介绍给大家认识？\n真珠星也想打响知名度吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1045_020meg", "source_sha256": "4af291a1469e9ff2c00778db69cea1d4cea041b6c26a8ac6016a2b24084d1b56", "ja": "いや、撮影する時に挨拶しに行くので……。\nていうか、なんで名前呼び捨て！？", "zh": "不是，拍摄时我会去打招呼的……  \n话说回来，为什么直接叫名字！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1046_017kth", "source_sha256": "9a0bf8f1c20c6021fee7939a943dd1ed329ff580d88eb143ea2f8c7b75c86150", "ja": "あはは！", "zh": "啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1047_020meg", "source_sha256": "11bc63a644dd33c2dc616c4dadd7c674382c4a45857e43f5ae890ff38c48619d", "ja": "（は、初めて会うタイプなんだけど、芸能人て\nみんなこうなの？　……て、見られてる！？　怖！）", "zh": "（是、是我第一次遇到的类型，不过，艺人全都是这样的吗？……等等，我被盯上了！？好可怕！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1048_019min", "source_sha256": "ec9b3fcc54c4cd16344d816efbc0e80203b81af42686bf21f70572b62bd573ec", "ja": "なんか、面倒くさいのに目つけられてるね。", "zh": "感觉你被什么麻烦的家伙盯上了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0345_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0345_story_03_1049_018ele", "source_sha256": "ef0935ce0ed6f0e16ea6b7f5ef694d6adbc186625abdcbc215b4946acfff2304", "ja": "織姫の妹だし、まあ予想の範囲内よ。免疫なさそう\nだけど、あの子、どうする気かしら……ふふっ。", "zh": "毕竟是织姬的妹妹嘛，也算在预料之中。看起来好像没什么抵抗力，那孩子打算怎么办呢……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
